//
// WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
// Until now a renewal could only debit the wallet (`worker/billing.ts` ->
// `debitWallet`). A customer with a perfectly good card on file was suspended the
// moment their wallet emptied, because `User.stripePaymentMethodId` was never
